      "section": "3.1 Derivative of Polynomials"
    },
    "hints": [
      "Use the power rule for each term: d/dx(x^n) = n*x^(n-1).",
      "The derivative of a constant like 7 is 0.",
      "Calculate 3*x^2 - 4."
